# Exclude node_modules / build output at ANY depth so the repo-root build context
# (now used by the frontend image too) never copies host-arch node_modules over the
# image's `npm ci`, nor stale dist. The frontend .env is excluded so only the
# build-arg controls VITE_USE_MOCKS (no passwordless-mock leak into the build).
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
frontend/.env
mobile/.env
.DS_Store
docs/.DS_Store
